  "task_assistant_messages": [
    "Let Shawna’s age be \\(x\\) years. Her father is therefore\n\n\\[\n6x \\text{ years old}.\n\\]\n\nUsing the age-based rule of paying **\\$1 per year of age each week**, Shawna’s father receives\n\n\\[\n6x \\text{ dollars per week}.\n\\]\n\nThus, the rule is: **pay an amount in dollars each week equal to the person’s age in years**; Shawna’s father’s allowance is six times Shawna’s allowance.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Father’s weekly allowance}=6(\\text{Shawna’s age})\\text{ dollars}}\n\\]",
